  "description": "Yeokdeok Yeong-Sun, who yearns for independence activist \"Bigak Kim Do-Hun,\" lives her life longingly! One day, a man suddenly appears in Bigak's house, recreated in a museum, and reveals himself to be Kim Do-Hun... and that she's the only one who can see, touch, and hear him?! \n\nA sweet romance between the man who \"lives\" in the museum and the woman who \"manages\" it.\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
